documentation.dataContract:
Eight authorized scalar (multiple:false) role tables. Every field may have null when not required; an empty date is null. Relationship fields are text containing the saved, authorized parent UUID (not display names or relationship arrays). Physical field keys are snake_case; map logical keys to approved physical names. The source table map must contain typeId, fields and writableFields per role. Do not invent UUIDs.
Expected teams: projects.expected_teams is a pipe-separated exact list from the updates.team select choices; a missing expected team can never count as zero work. Report period accepts YYYY-MM or ISO YYYY-Www. Sponsor-specific projects are independently scoped; TrialAgents Access enforces actual permission.
sponsors { name:text!, sponsor_code:text!, liaison_role:text?, contact_channel:text?, archived:boolean? }
projects { name:text!, sponsor_id:text!(UUID sponsors), project_code:text!, phase:select![Startup / Active delivery / Closeout / On hold], cro_pm:text!, cadence:select![Weekly / Biweekly / Monthly / Ad hoc], expected_teams:text!, status:select![Active / On hold / Closed], archived:boolean? }
milestones { name:text!, project_id:text!(UUID projects), owner:text!, baseline_date:date?, current_date:date!, actual_date:date?, status:select![Planned / In progress / Achieved / Blocked / Cancelled], change_reason:text?, evidence_ref:text?, archived:boolean? }
deliverables { name:text!, project_id:text!(UUID projects), owner:text!, due_date:date!, status:select![Planned / In progress / Submitted / Accepted / Rework], acceptance_evidence:text?, accepted_at:date?, sponsor_feedback:text?, archived:boolean? }
actions { name:text!, project_id:text!(UUID projects), kind:select![Risk / Issue / Action / Decision], owner:text!, priority:select![High / Medium / Low], status:select![Open / Blocked / Resolved / Approved / Rejected], due_date:date?, mitigation:text?, evidence_ref:text?, decision_by:text?, decision_at:date?, archived:boolean? }
updates { name:text!, project_id:text!(UUID projects), period_key:text!, team:select![Clinical Operations / Data Management / Regulatory / Medical Writing / Biostatistics / Quality / Vendor Management / Project Management / Other], revision:number!, contributor:text!, submitted_at:date?, status:select![Draft / Submitted / Changes requested / Accepted], highlights:text?, blockers:text?, next_steps:text?, source_refs:text?, reviewer:text?, reviewed_at:date?, archived:boolean? }
reports { name:text!, project_id:text!(UUID projects), period_key:text!, revision:number!, as_of:date!, status:select![Draft / In review / Approved], prepared_by:text!, narrative:text?, source_refs:text?, source_digest:text?, coverage_note:text?, reviewer:text?, reviewed_at:date?, archived:boolean? }
distributions { name:text!, project_id:text!(UUID projects), report_id:text!(UUID reports), sent_date:date!, channel:select![Manual email / Sponsor meeting / Shared workspace / Other], recipient_role:text!, recorded_by:text!, confirmation_ref:text!, archived:boolean? }
Special: milestone baseline_date is set from the initial current_date and immutable. A revised current_date requires change_reason. Accepted deliverable needs a prior Submitted record, evidence reference and actual accepted_at date. Accepted team input needs prior Submitted state, contributor-independent reviewer, reviewed_at and source_refs. Approved report requires prior In review, complete project evidence, every expected team accepted, current source_digest, narrative and independent reviewer. Manual distribution log requires approved report and dated confirmation_ref; it does NOT send anything.

